fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"base/gstadapter.html#gst_adapter_available","fragment":"\n\tgst_adapter_available\n\n\n\tGstBase.Adapter.prototype.available\n\n\n\tGstBase.Adapter.available\n\nGets the maximum amount of bytes available, that is it returns the maximum\nvalue that can be supplied to gst_adapter_map without that function\nreturning NULL.\nCalling gst_adapter_map with the amount of bytes returned by this function\nmay require expensive operations (like copying the data into a temporary\nbuffer) in some cases.\nParameters:\na GstAdapter\nnumber of bytes available in adapter\nGets the maximum amount of bytes available, that is it returns the maximum\nvalue that can be supplied to GstBase.Adapter.prototype.map without that function\nreturning null.\nCalling GstBase.Adapter.prototype.map with the amount of bytes returned by this function\nmay require expensive operations (like copying the data into a temporary\nbuffer) in some cases.\nParameters:\na GstBase.Adapter\nnumber of bytes available in adapter\nGets the maximum amount of bytes available, that is it returns the maximum\nvalue that can be supplied to GstBase.Adapter.map without that function\nreturning None.\nCalling GstBase.Adapter.map with the amount of bytes returned by this function\nmay require expensive operations (like copying the data into a temporary\nbuffer) in some cases.\nParameters:\na GstBase.Adapter\nnumber of bytes available in adapter\n"});